about that.

00:10:49.934 --> 00:10:52.601
And then I said,
the only thing I know to be true

00:10:52.601 --> 00:10:55.534
about the person who wrote
that is that they are a stepdad.

00:10:55.534 --> 00:10:57.601
And then that person, I guess,
just saw it,

00:10:57.601 --> 00:11:00.567
you know, they're catching up
on their corrections.

00:11:00.567 --> 00:11:03.300
And they said, "I am offended
that you would say that.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:07.601
How dare you? I am a step mom."

00:11:07.601 --> 00:11:09.501
Which is even cooler,

00:11:09.501 --> 00:11:13.267
like a stepmom
who loves that brand of music.

00:11:13.267 --> 00:11:16.200
Imagine getting that
in your life. What a dream.

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:22.033
What a dream.

00:11:22.033 --> 00:11:23.100
"You kids listening to music?"

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:26.200
Oh.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.167
