"Ah, Ed Sheeran, huh?

00:11:28.167 --> 00:11:32.200
I'm pretty cool.
He ever eat an animal on stage?"

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.133
Debbie!

00:11:34.133 --> 00:11:36.133
